FACTS = {
    'the-ice-king-s-contract': "In a city where freezing means death, Nova Reyes sacrifices everything for two passes into the last heated tower—only for her fiancé to betray her and leave her to die. Rescued by Cole Ashford, the icy billionaire who controls the city's heat, Nova discovers she's the only one who can warm his body. He offers to save her sick brother in exchange for sharing his bed every night, skin to skin. He swears he'll never touch her further unless she begs. Nova vows she never will.",
    'fiance-wed-my-sister-i-exposed-them': 'On her 25th birthday, Blythe Whitaker waited in vain for fiancé Ambrose, only to watch him marry her favored adoptive sister Savannah. Betrayed by her family, Blythe later lost her adoptive father after Savannah and Caleb provoked him to death, while Ambrose injured her. Done with love and family, Blythe gathered evidence and exposed Savannah’s crimes, fake pregnancy, and her mother’s lies. With Savannah facing prosecution, Blythe took her father’s ashes, left Atlanta, and started a new life.',
    'in-bed-with-the-cowboy-who-replaced-me': 'For eighteen years, Julian Vale was the perfect heir. Then a DNA test reveals he was switched at birth and brings home Cole Mercer, the true heir, a rough Texas cowboy meant to replace him. But Cole wants Julian closer than any rival should. As Julian trades elite lessons for ranch training, hostility turns into stolen kisses, one shared bed, and a desire Julian is terrified to name. When Julian calls him brother, Cole gives one warning: “Don’t call me brother again.” Losing the Vale name was supposed to destroy Julian. Wanting its real heir might.',
    'claim-his-heart': "To save her dying brother, she sets her sights on a ruthless billionaire. She'll seduce him, play his game, and do whatever it takes. But he's not a man who falls easily or forgives betrayal. As jealousy ignites and their dangerous game turns into an obsession, she risks losing the one thing she never meant to give him: her heart.",
    'my-fake-husband-is-my-daughter-s-billionaire-dad': "Small-town Lila flees a forced wedding, kisses a stranger in the Texas wild. Five years on, single mom to Sophia, she meets billionaire Murphy—who hires her as his fake wife. He's Sophia's father. After a forged-DNA plot and a farm showdown, they become a real family.",
    'i-taught-a-snake-woman-how-to-flirt-then-she-got-me-pregnant': 'Graduate student Isabella mistakes ancient overlord Medusa-Christine for an ordinary snakefolk and teaches her courtship songs—which Christine takes as a love confession. After Isabella flees, Christine abducts her; buried childhood memories resurface, untangling their misunderstandings. Isabella proposes, and they build a family with their serpent baby.',
    'the-devil-s-obsession': "Lily Clark travels to Sterling City to get money for her sick grandmother's surgery. On the train, she meets feared crime boss Alexander Vance, who falls for her after she tends his wounds. Forced into a marriage to save her grandma, Lily initially mistakes another man for her childhood savior. Gradually, she discovers Alexander is the boy who once rescued her. After fighting family plots and dangerous conflicts, the pair overcome hardships and embrace their true love at a grand wedding.",
    'my-new-dad-howls-at-the-moon': 'Six years ago, Elise fled the wedding arranged by her father and spent a passionate night with a mysterious stranger in a valley beneath the Blood Moon. By morning, he had vanished, and she could no longer even remember his face. Six years later, Elise lives in a rented apartment with her daughter, working three jobs just to make ends meet. When the school\'s new security guard saves her daughter from danger, the little girl looks up at him and suddenly calls him "Daddy." Desperate to escape another forced marriage arranged by her father, Elise impulsively marries the seemingly penniless security guard. But she has no idea that her new husband is actually the Alpha of a powerful wolf pack. Even worse, she doesn\'t know that he carries a secret execution order from the Council of Elders—commanding him to kill her half-blood daughter. And the date on that deadly order? Just two days before their marriage certificate was signed.',
    'the-rival-heiress-who-tamed-the-mafia-king': "Criminal psychologist Claire mistakes Kent, a blood-soaked Mafia King, for an inmate and tells him he desperately needs to get laid. Days later, he kidnaps her to his estate out West, where she discovers she's the long-lost heiress of a rival Mafia family, promised to his son. She's meant to marry the son, yet secretly climbs into the father's bed. When outside money moves to seize the West, Claire must unite two rival families, protect their homeland, and rise as the Queen of the West.",
    'the-bride-they-threw-away': "Before the grand pairing, House Ashford crosses out their true daughter Vera's name, throwing her to Alaric—the city’s crippled, feral Black Lion—so the fake daughter can steal the heir. Instead of begging, Vera publicly accepts the doomed match. Banished to the desolate Grey House, Vera uncovers a deadly secret: Alaric’s beast is chained by his own family's poison. While her abusers forge a decree to enslave her as a maid, the hidden apothecary brews the antidote. The crippled Alpha opens his eyes, and the true slaughter begins.",
    'all-magic-s-true-master': "Magic prodigy Alan, son of the Minister of Magic, gave his cheating girlfriend Hailey everything. She framed him for a dragon massacre and let her lover Drake push him to his death. Shy healer Emily's tears send him back in time. Reborn, Alan stops obeying her. Hailey's been posing as the Gallagher heiress and calling him the coachman's son. Now he'll expose every lie, crush Drake in a duel, and throw the most lavish birthday bash in the magic world for the girl who truly loved him all along.",
    'halloween-system-kiss-or-kill': "Trick or Treat? More like Kiss or Die! Sophia's Halloween just got a whole lot hotter and deadlier. A gorgeous Reaper is turning an amusement park into a bloodbath, and her secret Love Survival System has one wicked demand: kiss him, seduce him, and get into his bed. Refuse, and she's dead. Give in, and she might live to see another round. But every sexy but deadly move brings her closer to the monster running the show. And the more he wants her, the harder it gets to escape his deadly games.",
    'she-took-my-place-i-took-a-god': 'In ancient Olympia, priestess Kassandra was betrayed by her fiancé Dionysios and sister Myrto, falling into the abyss with her newborn. Reborn on the eve of the priestess selection, she seizes her fate, outshining Myrto to become the chosen priestess. She journeys to the abyss and unites with the gatekeeper Alexios, bearing triplets marked with dark-gold lightning runes. Dionysios and Myrto plot repeatedly, but their schemes fail. When the infants\' resonance test reveals the truth, Myrto\'s conspiracy is exposed and Dionysios\'s reverse sealing wedge is shattered. Desperate, Dionysios unleashes the abyss, only for Alexios to manifest his divine form and destroy the artifact. As Kassandra and Alexios grow closer, Dionysios abducts their eldest son Telemachus. At the public trial, Kassandra exposes his crimes, but he reveals the third inscribed key is sewn into his chest. Facing his threat and the gatekeeper\'s fated death, Kassandra proposes "Converge the Three Powers into One." At the final judgment, Myrto\'s conscience awakens. She testifies and takes a fatal blow meant for Kassandra. Alexios shatters the key, restores his godhood, and permanently seals the abyss. Myrto survives. Kassandra and Alexios are crowned, their three sons acknowledged, and the family finds their happy ending.',
    'the-roman-war-god-s-tribute': "Sold into slavery by her cruel stepmother, fallen Numidian princess Lenora spends one night with Rome's war god, General Lucius Valerius, who leaves her his signet ring. A few months later, she gives birth to a boy alone and sells the ring to save their sick son, never knowing the buyer is Lucius's mother. Lucius has been searching for her ever since. Once he learns the truth, he rescues Lenora and brings her home. Now, against a jealous rival and a powerful senator, she must fight to protect her child.",
    'the-blind-dragon-king-s-virgin-bride': 'To save her mother, Vanessa ventures alone into the territory of the dragon clan, where she meets Caesar, the Dragon King consumed by a death curse. Thus begins a romantic and fantastical love story.',
    'the-billionaire-s-daughter-chose-me': 'At sixteen, Beatriz’s foster mother sold her eggs on the black market, stealing her chance to ever have children of her own. Years later, Beatriz is working as a school janitor when she risks her life to save a little girl from a kidnapping. That brave act brings her face-to-face with the girl’s father—a mysterious billionaire locked in a bitter custody battle. Desperate to protect his daughter, he makes Beatriz an unexpected offer: a flash marriage.',
    'my-ex-is-the-undefeated-champion': 'Nora Bennett and Roman Vale were the golden couple of college. On the night Roman won the national amateur fighting championship and was about to sign his first pro contract, Nora discovered she was pregnant—and diagnosed with stage III breast cancer. To keep him from abandoning his dreams, she staged an affair with their friend Julian, forcing Roman to break up with her. She went abroad alone, gave birth to their daughter, and endured chemotherapy and surgery. Eight years later, Roman returns to Los Angeles on an eleven-fight win streak, ready to challenge for the title. But new league rules require medical clearance from an independent physician. The doctor assigned to evaluate him is Nora. Roman has hated her for eight years. Now one signature from her could decide his career. But Nora hides two truths: their seven-year-old daughter—his flesh and blood—and a knee imaging report he secretly underwent, automatically synced to her medical terminal. As Roman prepares for the biggest fight of his life, the woman he believes betrayed him may be the only one who can save his career—and the one holding the truth that could shatter everything.',
    'married-the-mafia-don-now-my-ex-regrets-everything': 'Ivy endured years as a quiet, devoted wife, only to be brutally betrayed and thrown into a blizzard by her arrogant ex. With nowhere else to go, she flash-marries Aiden, the dangerous stranger she saved years ago. Passion ignites as Aiden ruthlessly shields her from her toxic ex and empowers her to finally stand on her own. When her ex regrets his mistake and comes crawling back, Ivy has already moved on—and her new husband? A lethal predator her ex can never even dream of touching...',
}
